<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>kimju.zip — 정비 중</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'%3E%3Crect width='24' height='24' rx='6' fill='%230c0c0c'/%3E%3Cpath d='M7 12h10M12 7v10' stroke='%23b8f03c' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fonts-archive/NanumSquareRound/NanumSquareRound.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:#0c0c0c;color:#fff;
    font-family:'Nanum Square Round',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;
    text-align:center;padding:24px;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:420px}
  .badge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(184,240,60,.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(184,240,60,.3);color:#b8f03c;
    padding:7px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#b8f03c;animation:p 1.6s infinite}
  @keyframes p{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
  h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.4}
  p{font-size:14.5px;color:#9a9a9a;line-height:1.75}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span> 정비 중</span>
    <h1>잠시 자리를 비웠어요<br>곧 정리해서 돌아올게요</h1>
    <p>이용 중인 프로그램의 안내 페이지는 그대로 열려 있습니다.<br>주소를 알고 계시면 바로 접속하실 수 있어요.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
